<title>USA: N.Y. Fed Press Briefing - August 7.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Fed Press Briefing - August 7.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said it had no large one-day net miss in its reserve projections in the latest week, a Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The high in natural float was about $1.24 billion on Wednesday, while the low in natural float was about $150 million on Friday.</p>
<p>Transportation float averaged about $30 million per day with the high on Wednesday at about $150 million primarily due to missed shipments to New Orleans and Birmingham.</p>
<p>(( -- Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
